{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id73019017"}, "name":{"label":"Mzoukas"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-08-28T11:41:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1055144253"}, "title":{"label":"Everything I could hope for"}, "content":{"label":"I have been using the actual Noisli site for a good while now and as soon as I found out about the app, I downloaded is right away on both my iPad and iphone. I was not let down as the app is exactly like the site. The ability to travel to a coffee shop and sit next to a fireplace while sitting in my desk at work, on my commute, or at a random location is the most beautiful thing i could ask for. I hope to see a desktop app in the future where I don’t need to use my internet browser and can control the volume from the control bar ;) just a future thought to the developers… anyways thanks for creating a beautiful app that works perfectly :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id408441084"}, "name":{"label":"Yuukumini"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-08-25T09:08:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1053242551"}, "title":{"label":"Beautiful"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app! I have looked at the website many times before and am glad that I downloaded the app. I have a lot of relaxing sound apps but I really love this one because the layout is so beautiful and minimal. I love the choice of sounds too. I would love to be able to choose a color as a set background and be able to control the amount of birds on the forest sound. This is a premium app at a great price and I highly recommend it. Thank you for making a great app!!! ^^*", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id408108703"}, "name":{"label":"1337mando"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-08-17T22:31:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"1048676794"}, "title":{"label":"Lifesaver for Parents!"}, "content":{"label":"I cannot tell you how many times I've used this app to help me baby get to sleep. There are some nights she just needs a little white noise and Noisli is perfect. I can also use it myself to create the perfect mix to help me sleep as well. Thanks guys for turning your site into an app, you've really saved me!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id162993967"}, "name":{"label":"Shortone76"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-07-19T11:34:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"1031380818"}, "title":{"label":"Love this app!!!"}, "content":{"label":"I've been looking for something (cd, app, etc) to help block out noise while working. While reading O, Noisli was mentioned. I immediately downloaded the app. I love that you can combined different sounds! Can't wait to use at work!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
