{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id37322992"}, "name":{"label":"scoodog"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-06-17T11:52:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"1012018386"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant app"}, "content":{"label":"Noisli is a brilliant app.  There is no better app for background sounds.  It helps me focus so much.  I love the combinations I can make.  I like the idea from another reviewer of adding AirPlay support — that’d be awesome.  And, I’d happily purchase additional packages of sounds if the maker of the app wishes to create some and make them available.  Thank you!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id192480674"}, "name":{"label":"applesareyummy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-06-12T07:32:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"1008993241"}, "title":{"label":"Absolutely amazing"}, "content":{"label":"I rarely spend money on apps, but this one is so well executed with a very practical (yet beautiful) use that getting it was no brainer. I use this for creative writing and relaxing mostly. Two things I'd love to see as a user...I noticed that in certain situations two knobs will appear on one sound and the second won't go away till I restart the app. The second thought is that a true fan sound (for cooling down) would be helpful for people who are used to sleeping with a fan. I know, ideas are a dime a dozen ;). But this is definitely the best and most useful app I have seen in awhile! Thanks!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id370059284"}, "name":{"label":"Ctk overload"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-06-10T04:07:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"1007869800"}, "title":{"label":"Favorite relaxation/noise blocker"}, "content":{"label":"Love the simple, beautiful interface. Nice, intuitive sound mixing and fade out timer. Just looking at it is calming!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id37355265"}, "name":{"label":"MisterBiscuits1978"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-06-04T10:36:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"1004376968"}, "title":{"label":"Loved it on web, great to have it on iPhone!"}, "content":{"label":"---update---\nI used noisli on a trip to Korea recently. Paired with Bose QC headphones it made the flight really easy to get through (12 hours in economy at 6'5\" tall doesn't usually feel easy!). Then we had a 5 hour middle-of-the-night bus journey which noisli helped me sleep through most of. Finally, it was great for jetlag sleep. Thank you!\n\n---Old review----\nI use the website at work to drown out the AC hum and the louder desk meetings that happen often. I'm really happy I can now plug in to my iPhone to get the same effect and can't wait to have this paired with my noise canceling headphones on long flights. \n\nThe sounds are high quality and you rarely hear a loop restart or skip. \n\nThe only negative I have is the size of the app. At around 240MB it would have been too much for my 16GB iPhones. Glad I got a 32GB one this time so I can keep this app without worry :-)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id123854491"}, "name":{"label":"Toddwfisk"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-05-23T13:43:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"997628951"}, "title":{"label":"I LOVE this app"}, "content":{"label":"It has all the right choices and the sound is fantastic. Interface is simple and gorgeous. Living in the city, I LOVE using this app and soothing or focusing my body, brain and soul with this app. If only ALL my other apps were this good. Kudos!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id314561119"}, "name":{"label":"Yo Over Here"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-05-23T09:44:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"997553221"}, "title":{"label":"Thank you"}, "content":{"label":"Just wanted to say thanks for real sounds and adjustable volume for each sound. The preset combos are just a bonus really. I have to point out that other apps sub in the pink noise for a fan or short loops for a bubbling brook.. This app uses long loops and genuine sounds. I'm working on spreadsheets but my mind is in a forrest listening to birds chirping. Better than listening to my neighbors typing their report! Thank you thank you!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
